WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.417
- [Melissa Proctor:]
The energy of Atlanta

00:00:01.417 --> 00:00:03.708
is incredibly interesting,
and I think it's different

00:00:03.708 --> 00:00:04.792
than anywhere in the nation.

00:00:04.792 --> 00:00:07.500
The idea of mixing
Southern hospitality

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.458
with kind of an old-school
Southern flair

00:00:09.458 --> 00:00:12.292
with a lot of new energy,
pop culture.

00:00:12.292 --> 00:00:13.417
- [John Collins:] The colleges,

00:00:13.417 --> 00:00:15.917
the amount of Black businesses
that are here,

00:00:15.917 --> 00:00:18.042
Atlanta strives
for Black excellence.

00:00:18.042 --> 00:00:19.917
- There's a great energy
about the city.

00:00:19.917 --> 00:00:24.083
I can identify with the legacy
and the history of civil rights.

00:00:24.083 --> 00:00:26.208
- This was the backyard
of some of the greatest

00:00:26.208 --> 00:00:28.167
civil rights leaders
of all times.

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:30.125
- The SCLC being founded
in Atlanta,

00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:31.792
the history of Black leadership.

00:00:31.792 --> 00:00:33.625
- [Wilkins:]
Maynard Jackson and Andrew Young

00:00:33.625 --> 00:00:37.500
and Dr. King,
all of them started here,

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:41.625
really put Atlanta
on the world map.

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:43.875
- When Nike came on board
with the NBA

00:00:43.875 --> 00:00:46.708
and created
the City Edition platform—

00:00:46.708 --> 00:00:48.542
- It was kind of
a revolutionary idea

00:00:48.542 --> 00:00:50.875
to, like, have a jersey
that ties to the city

00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:53.542
and is expressive
and allows for teams to tell

00:00:53.542 --> 00:00:55.625
community stories
in impactful ways.

00:00:55.625 --> 00:00:58.000
- My very first year
was trying to distinguish

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.458
what the City Edition
would be for this season.

00:01:00.458 --> 00:01:02.917
So, it's been about
a three-year-long process.

00:01:02.917 --> 00:01:04.792
The idea of partnering
with the King estate

00:01:04.792 --> 00:01:07.792
was an early idea that I had.
- When the Hawks approached us

00:01:07.792 --> 00:01:10.292
about the MLK City Edition
uniform concept,

00:01:10.292 --> 00:01:11.333
we were very intrigued.

00:01:11.333 --> 00:01:12.792
Whenever we have an opportunity,

00:01:12.792 --> 00:01:16.625
we try to move Dr. King
from the history books

00:01:16.625 --> 00:01:19.083
and into the lives
of younger generations.

00:01:19.083 --> 00:01:22.292
- And so sitting down with
the Nike team, they embraced it.

00:01:22.292 --> 00:01:23.625
- We actually had a team member

00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:25.875
who traveled out to Atlanta
to visit with the team

00:01:25.875 --> 00:01:28.167
and got a lot of pictures
and inspiration.

00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:29.708
- [Proctor:] Went to
Ebenezer Baptist Church

00:01:29.708 --> 00:01:31.333
and went to the King Center.

00:01:31.333 --> 00:01:33.167
- When he brought all that back,

00:01:33.167 --> 00:01:35.667
it was just really inspiring.

00:01:35.667 --> 00:01:37.458
- [Proctor:] In partnership
with the King estate

00:01:37.458 --> 00:01:40.167
in developing this entire idea,
they were so excited.

00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:41.583
- There was no hesitation at all

00:01:41.583 --> 00:01:43.458
on linking Dr. King's
legacy to sports.

00:01:43.458 --> 00:01:46.792
We realize the power of sports
and the medium that it is,

00:01:46.792 --> 00:01:48.208
so we thought
it made perfect sense

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:49.708
to partner
with the Hawks on this.

00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:52.333
- Honoring Dr. King
is a natural connection for us.

00:01:52.333 --> 00:01:54.958
- We knew that, like,
this is more than just a jersey.

00:01:54.958 --> 00:01:56.917
It means so much more to us.

00:01:56.917 --> 00:01:59.417
♪♪♪

00:01:59.417 --> 00:02:01.792
- [Tidwell:] Each element
of the design of the uniform has

00:02:01.792 --> 00:02:03.292
a specific meaning and intent,

00:02:03.292 --> 00:02:04.792
so it was well thought out
in that way.

00:02:04.792 --> 00:02:06.375
- There were a number of
elements to the uniform

00:02:06.375 --> 00:02:08.167
that really speaks to Dr. King.

00:02:08.167 --> 00:02:10.958
Obviously, the black and gold
as a nod to his fraternity,

00:02:10.958 --> 00:02:12.667
Alpha Phi Alpha.

00:02:12.667 --> 00:02:14.333
- The side panel on the shorts,

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:16.500
we had intended that arch
to kinda hearken back

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.292
to church window panes.

00:02:18.292 --> 00:02:20.500
- [Proctor:] The stars represent
the student freedom fighters

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:21.708
that were a part
of the movement.

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:24.167
- [Coleman:] The wordmark,
obviously reading “MLK,”

00:02:24.167 --> 00:02:25.458
that's never been done before,

00:02:25.458 --> 00:02:27.542
a person's initials being donned
on the jersey.

00:02:27.542 --> 00:02:29.458
- [Proctor:] All of it comes
together to really represent

00:02:29.458 --> 00:02:31.750
what this uniform
means to the city of Atlanta.

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.583
- I had a chance
to get a sneak peek at ‘em.

00:02:33.583 --> 00:02:35.042
- It’s just, it’s pure fire.

00:02:35.042 --> 00:02:36.333
- I'm getting texts and calls

00:02:36.333 --> 00:02:38.458
that people were gonna
go get it.

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:40.000
- [Tidwell:]
The NBA definitely seems to be

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.583
the league that's leading

00:02:41.583 --> 00:02:44.292
the encouragement
of athlete activism.

00:02:44.292 --> 00:02:45.833
- Continue to uplift
all the other athletes,

00:02:45.833 --> 00:02:47.458
to let them know
that they can say

00:02:47.458 --> 00:02:50.458
and do what's right.
- We won't be silent.

00:02:50.458 --> 00:02:52.417
Enough is enough.
- To wear those three letters

00:02:52.417 --> 00:02:54.792
across our chest, it's
gotta mean something to you.

00:02:54.792 --> 00:02:56.125
- I gotta play just
a little bit harder

00:02:56.125 --> 00:02:57.708
when I have that jersey on.

00:02:57.708 --> 00:03:00.375
- This is not just a new
uniform. It is a commitment.

00:03:00.375 --> 00:03:02.083
- We can continue to have
those conversations

00:03:02.083 --> 00:03:04.625
about what Dr. King's legacy
truly means

00:03:04.625 --> 00:03:06.625
and what we can do
to play our part

00:03:06.625 --> 00:03:08.792
in addressing
the efforts moving forward.

00:03:08.792 --> 00:03:11.417
- I try to carry out his legacy
and his messages.

00:03:11.417 --> 00:03:13.042
I look at everybody
as an individual.

00:03:13.042 --> 00:03:14.625
It's not the color of your skin.

00:03:14.625 --> 00:03:15.917
It's the content
of your character.

00:03:15.917 --> 00:03:18.417
- It's so important
to keep educating ourselves

00:03:18.417 --> 00:03:22.375
about the importance
of equality.

00:03:22.375 --> 00:03:24.375
That message will never get old.

00:03:24.375 --> 00:03:26.292
- I don't know if there’s
another way

00:03:26.292 --> 00:03:28.833
that you can represent
the city of Atlanta better

00:03:28.833 --> 00:03:31.375
than representing through
Dr. Martin Luther King.

00:03:31.375 --> 00:03:33.625
- We want this uniform
to really be something

00:03:33.625 --> 00:03:35.458
historic that people hold on to

00:03:35.458 --> 00:03:37.458
and really take pride in
for years to come.

00:03:37.458 --> 00:03:39.625
But we wanna make sure that
we continue this conversation

00:03:39.625 --> 00:03:41.208
and that people
don't just talk about it,

00:03:41.208 --> 00:03:42.458
they do the work.

00:03:42.458 --> 00:03:45.208
And earning these letters for us
means exactly that.

00:03:45.208 --> 00:03:49.083
♪♪♪

